g behavior, edge cases, and exit codes. Do not implement behavior not specified in the PRD.\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"cmd/expand/main.go compiles without errors (go build ./cmd/expand/)\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"expand converts tabs to spaces with default tab stop of 8\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"expand -t N sets uniform tab width; expand -t N1,N2,... sets explicit tab stop positions\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"expand -i converts only leading tabs on each line\"\n      - id: AC5\n        text: \"Differential tests in cmd/expand/expand_test.go pass against gexpand (go test ./cmd/expand/)\"\n      - id: AC6\n        text: \"Tests skip gracefully with t.Skip when gexpand is not in PATH\"\n      - id: AC7\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/expand/ reports no issues\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4ae3c1b3-b046-4e44-b625-45aa4d7f47aa","total_cost_usd":0.2434975,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27534,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2856,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27534,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":2856,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":27534,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2434975,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"e7a8f3e0-0d84-4962-90d1-330b25be0721"}
